@host = http://localhost:8080

### Stato generale
GET {{host}}/api/paper/status

### Segnali recenti
GET {{host}}/api/paper/signals

### Nota
# Gli ingressi LONG/SHORT devono passare dal flusso segnali, che crea un TradePlan
# con position sizing e RiskManager. /api/paper/orders accetta ordini diretti solo
# se riducono o chiudono una posizione gia' aperta.

### Segnale manuale solo registrato, senza ordine
POST {{host}}/api/paper/signals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "action": "BUY",
  "price": 600.00,
  "quantity": 1,
  "reason": "test-manuale",
  "execute": false
}

### Ordine MARKET paper
POST {{host}}/api/paper/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 1,
  "reason": "test-market-paper"
}

### Ordine LIMIT paper
POST {{host}}/api/paper/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "quantity": 1,
  "limitPrice": 590.00,
  "reason": "test-limit-paper"
}

### Ordine STOP paper
POST {{host}}/api/paper/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "STOP",
  "quantity": 1,
  "stopPrice": 580.00,
  "reason": "protective-stop-paper"
}

### Trailing stop percentuale paper
POST {{host}}/api/paper/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "TRAILING_STOP",
  "quantity": 1,
  "trailingPercent": 1.0,
  "reason": "protective-trailing-paper"
}

### Bracket: entry + take profit + stop loss
POST {{host}}/api/paper/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "BRACKET",
  "quantity": 1,
  "takeProfitPrice": 612.00,
  "stopPrice": 588.00,
  "reason": "bracket-paper"
}

### Bracket: entry + take profit + trailing stop
POST {{host}}/api/paper/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "BRACKET_WITH_TRAILING_STOP",
  "quantity": 1,
  "takeProfitPrice": 612.00,
  "trailingPercent": 1.0,
  "reason": "bracket-trailing-paper"
}

### Ordini tracciati
GET {{host}}/api/paper/orders

### Posizioni
GET {{host}}/api/paper/positions

### Chiusura posizione
POST {{host}}/api/paper/positions/SPY/close

### Attiva kill switch
POST {{host}}/api/paper/kill-switch/activate

### Disattiva kill switch
POST {{host}}/api/paper/kill-switch/deactivate
